qu''une blockchain sécurisée","comment fonctionne hegemon-testnet-join"],"de":["wie man einer Blockchain beitritt","KI-Tools für Blockchain","Sicherheit in der Blockchain","Privatsphäre in der Blockchain","hegemon-testnet-join vs andere","Installationsanleitung für hegemon-testnet-join","Alternativen zu hegemon-testnet-join","was ist eine quantensichere Blockchain","wie funktioniert hegemon-testnet-join"],"pt":["hegemon-testnet-join","blockchain resistente ao quantum","privacidade na blockchain","segurança na blockchain","desenvolvimento de aplicativos descentralizados","como usar hegemon-testnet-join","hegemon-testnet-join vs outras blockchains"],"ru":["hegemon-testnet-join","квантово-устойчивая блокчейна","конфиденциальность в блокчейне","безопасность в блокчейне","разработка децентрализованных приложений","как использовать hegemon-testnet-join","hegemon-testnet-join против других блокчейн"],"ar":["hegemon-testnet-join","بلوكشين مقاوم للكمية","الخصوصية في البلوكشين","الأمان في البلوكشين","تطوير تطبيقات لامركزية","كيفية استخدام hegemon-testnet-join","hegemon-testnet-join مقابل البلوكشين الأخرى"]}},"owner":"Pauli-Group","repo":"Hegemon","repoPath":"Pauli-Group/Hegemon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.747Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hegemon-testnet-join","description":"Join the Hegemon testnet using the shared chainspec, verify genesis, sync to the tip, and enable mining safely.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Goal\nConnect a new node to the Hegemon testnet, verify it is on the canonical chain, and mine only after sync completes.\n\n# Defaults\n- Boot node: hegemon.pauli.group:30333\n- Chain spec: config/dev-chainspec.json\n- Genesis hash: 0xcaa718106d1530705c53a99628d929cd78d47a0bf06b177aa4853962b47c637d\n- RPC port: 9944\n- P2P listen: /ip4/0.0.0.0/tcp/30333\n\n# Steps\n1. Ensure binaries exist (fresh clones must run make setup and make node):\n   - make setup\n   - make node\n   - cargo build --release -p wall","body":"# Goal\nConnect a new node to the Hegemon testnet, verify it is on the canonical chain, and mine only after sync completes.\n\n# Defaults\n- Boot node: hegemon.pauli.group:30333\n- Chain spec: config/dev-chainspec.json\n- Genesis hash: 0xcaa718106d1530705c53a99628d929cd78d47a0bf06b177aa4853962b47c637d\n- RPC port: 9944\n- P2P listen: /ip4/0.0.0.0/tcp/30333\n\n# Steps\n1. Ensure binaries exist (fresh clones must run make setup and make node):\n   - make setup\n   - make node\n   - cargo build --release -p walletd\n2. Verify the shared chainspec matches the boot node. Do not use --chain dev.\n   - shasum -a 256 config/dev-chainspec.json\n3. Create or open a wallet and export the shielded mining address:\n   - export HEGEMON_MINER_ADDRESS=$(printf ''%s\\n{\"id\":1,\"method\":\"status.get\",\"params\":{}}\\n'' \"YOUR_PASSPHRASE\" \\\n     | ./target/release/walletd --store ~/.hegemon-wallet --mode open \\\n     | jq -r ''.result.primaryAddress'')\n4. Start the node with the shared chainspec and seed:\n   - HEGEMON_MINE=1 \\\n     HEGEMON_SEEDS=\"hegemon.pauli.group:30333\" \\\n     HEGEMON_MINER_ADDRESS=\"$HEGEMON_MINER_ADDRESS\" \\\n     ./target/release/hegemon-node \\\n       --dev \\\n       --base-path ~/.hegemon-node \\\n       --chain config/dev-chainspec.json \\\n       --listen-addr /ip4/0.0.0.0/tcp/30333 \\\n       --rpc-port 9944 \\\n       --rpc-external \\\n       --rpc-methods safe \\\n       --name \"TestnetNode\"\n5. Monitor sync status and height. Mining pauses while syncing and resumes once caught up.\n   - curl -s -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -d ''{\"id\":1,\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"system_health\"}'' \\\n     http://127.0.0.1:9944 | jq\n   - curl -s -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -d ''{\"id\":1,\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"hegemon_consensusStatus\"}'' \\\n     http://127.0.0.1:9944 | jq\n   - curl -s -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -d ''{\"id\":1,\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"chain_getHeader\"}'' \\\n     http://127.0.0.1:9944 | jq\n6. If height stalls, check peers and genesis hash:\n   - curl -s -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -d ''{\"id\":1,\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"chain_getBlockHash\",\"params\":[0]}'' \\\n     http://127.0.0.1:9944 | jq\n\n# Notes\n- If the genesis hash or chainspec differ, stop the node and wipe the base path before restarting.\n- Keep RPC access locked down if you expose it beyond localhost.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:09:59.904Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Blockchain Agents needing to join and interact with the Hegemon testnet.","zh":"非常适合需要加入和与 Hegemon 测试网交互的区块链代理。","ja":"Hegemon テストネットに参加し、相互作用する必要があるブロックチェーン エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Hegemon 테스트넷에参加하고 상호 작용할 블록체인 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Blockchain que necesitan unirse e interactuar con la red de prueba de Hegemon.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Blockchain qui ont besoin de rejoindre et d''interagir avec le testnet de Hegemon.","de":"Perfekt für Blockchain-Agents, die der Hegemon-Testnet joinen und mit ihr interagieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Blockchain que precisam se juntar e interagir com a testnet Hegemon.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов блокчейна, которым необходимо присоединиться и взаимодействовать с тестовой сетью Hegemon.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء سلاسل الكتل الذين يحتاجون إلى الانضمام والتفاعل مع شبكة اختبار Hegemon."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to connect to the Hegemon testnet, verify node connections, and mine after sync completion using quantum-resistant and private blockchain protocols.","zh":"赋予代理连接到 Hegemon 测试网、验证节点连接并在同步完成后使用量子抗性和私有区块链协议进行挖矿的能力。","ja":"エージェントが Hegemon テストネットに接続し、ノード接続を検証し、同期完了後に量子耐性とプライベート ブロックチェーン プロトコルを使用してマイニングできるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Hegemon 테스트넷에 연결하고 노드 연결을 검증한 후 양자 저항 및 사적 블록체인 프로토콜을 사용하여 동기화 완료 후 마이닝할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a conectarse al testnet de Hegemon, verificar conexiones de nodos y minar después de la finalización de la sincronización utilizando protocolos de blockchain resistentes al cuántico y privados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de se connecter au testnet de Hegemon, de vérifier les connexions de nœuds et de miner après l''achèvement de la synchronisation en utilisant des protocoles de blockchain résistants au quantique et privés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, sich mit dem Hegemon-Testnet zu verbinden, Knotenverbindungen zu überprüfen und nach der Synchronisierung mit quantenresistenten und privaten Blockchain-Protokollen zu minen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se conectar à testnet Hegemon, verificar conexões de nós e minerar após a conclusão da sincronização usando protocolos de blockchain resistentes ao quantum e privados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью подключаться к тестовой сети Hegemon, проверять соединения узлов и проводить майнинг после завершения синхронизации с использованием квантово-устойчивых и частных протоколов блокчейна.","ar":"يتوفر للوكلاء khảية الاتصال بشبكة اختبار Hegemon، ومراجعة اتصالات العقد، وتنقيب بعد إكمال المزامنة باستخدام بروتوكولات سلاسل الكتل المقاومة للكم والخاصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Joining the Hegemon testnet","Verifying node connections to the canonical chain","Mining after sync completion"],"zh":["加入 Hegemon 测试网","验证节点连接到正典链","同步完成后挖矿"],"ja":["Hegemon テストネットに参加する","カノニカル チェーンへのノード接続を検証する","同期完了後にマイニングする"],"ko":["Hegemon 테스트넷에参加하기","노드 연결을 검증하여 표준 체인에 연결하기","동기화 완료 후 마이닝하기"],"es":["Unirse al testnet de Hegemon","Verificar conexiones de nodos a la cadena canónica","Minar después de la finalización de la sincronización"],"fr":["Rejoindre le testnet de Hegemon","Vérifier les connexions de nœuds à la chaîne canonique","Miner après l''achèvement de la synchronisation"],"de":["Dem Hegemon-Testnet beitreten","Knotenverbindungen zur kanonischen Kette überprüfen","Nach der Synchronisierung minen"],"pt":["Participar da testnet Hegemon","Verificar conexões de nós para a cadeia canônica","Minerar após conclusão da sincronização"],"ru":["Присоединение к тестовой сети Hegemon","Проверка соединений узлов с канонической цепью","Майнинг после завершения синхронизации"],"ar":["الانضمام إلى شبكة اختبار Hegemon","مراجعة اتصالات العقد مع السلسلة المقبولة","التنقيب بعد إكمال المزامنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires binaries to exist and setup","Specific to the Hegemon testnet"],"zh":["需要二进制文件存在和设置","特定于 Hegemon 测试网"],"ja":["バイナリが存在し、設定されている必要がある","Hegemon テストネットに特有"],"ko":["바이너리가 존재하고 설정되어야 함","Hegemon 테스트넷에 특정"],"es":["Requiere que los binarios existan y estén configurados","Específico del testnet de Hegemon"],"fr":["Nécessite que les binaires existent et soient configurés","Spécifique au testnet de Hegemon"],"de":["Benötigt die Existenz und Einrichtung von Binärdateien","Spezifisch für das Hegemon-Testnet"],"pt":["Exige a existência e configuração de binários","Específico para a testnet Hegemon"],"ru":["Требует наличия и настройки бинарных файлов","Специфичен для тестовой сети Hegemon"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود وإعداد ثنائيات","محدد لشبكة اختبار Hegemon"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"650909f8afb436bb0aca2121450c15d683bc2f24c6a77a23fecdfee86677961f","qualityScore":20}');
