uration avec yadm","Automatisation de tâches dans le réseau domestique","Gestion de réseaux de computateurs","Gestion de sécurité dans le réseau domestique","Gestion de ressources dans le réseau domestique"],"de":["Verwaltung von Konfigurationsdateien mit yadm","Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Heimnetzwerk","Verwaltung von Netzwerken von Computern","Verwaltung von Sicherheit im Heimnetzwerk","Verwaltung von Ressourcen im Heimnetzwerk"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de dotfiles com yadm","Configuração de rede eficiente","Otimização de dispositivos de rede","Segurança de rede avançada","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Управление dotfiles с помощью yadm","Эффективная настройка сети","Оптимизация сетевых устройств","Расширенная безопасность сети","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إدارة dotfiles مع يادم","ضبط شبكة فعال","تحسين أجهزة الشبكة","أمان الشبكة المتقدم","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用home-network-admin","什么是dotfiles仓库","home-network-admin安装","home-network-admin配置","home-network-admin alternative","home-network-admin vs 其他AI代理","dotfiles仓库管理","网络管理解决方案","AI智能代理"],"ja":["home-network-adminの使い方","dotfilesリポジトリとは","home-network-adminのインストール","home-network-adminの設定","home-network-adminの代替","home-network-admin vs 他のAIエージェント","dotfilesリポジトリ管理","ネットワーク管理ソリューション","AIエージェント"],"ko":["home-network-admin 사용 방법","dotfiles 리포지토리란","home-network-admin 설치","home-network-admin 설정","home-network-admin 대체","home-network-admin vs 다른 AI 에이전트","dotfiles 리포지토리 관리","네트워크 관리 솔루션","AI 에이전트"],"es":["agente de red doméstica","gestión de redes de computadoras","yadm","automatización de tareas en la red doméstica","gestión de seguridad en la red doméstica","gestión de recursos en la red doméstica"],"fr":["agent de réseau domestique","gestion de réseaux de computateurs","yadm","automatisation de tâches dans le réseau domestique","gestion de sécurité dans le réseau domestique","gestion de ressources dans le réseau domestique"],"de":["Netzwerk-Admin für Heimnetzwerke","Verwaltung von Netzwerken von Computern","yadm","Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Heimnetzwerk","Verwaltung von Sicherheit im Heimnetzwerk","Verwaltung von Ressourcen im Heimnetzwerk"],"pt":["como usar yadm","o que é administração de rede","ferramentas de administração de rede","yadm vs outras ferramentas","instalar yadm","guia de configuração de yadm","otimizar rede com yadm","segurança de rede com yadm"],"ru":["как использовать yadm","что такое администрирование сети","инструменты администрирования сети","yadm vs другие инструменты","установить yadm","руководство по настройке yadm","оптимизировать сеть с yadm","безопасность сети с yadm"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام يادم","ما هي إدارة الشبكة","أدوات إدارة الشبكة","يادم مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت يادم","دليل ضبط يادم","تحسين الشبكة مع يادم","أمان الشبكة مع يادم"]}},"owner":"tdhopper","repo":"dotfiles2.0","repoPath":"tdhopper/dotfiles2.0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.686Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"home-network-admin","description":"Manage and troubleshoot Tims home network, SSH into devices, administer the Synology NAS, and work with Tailscale. Use when the user wants to (1) SSH into or run commands on remote machines (synology, dobro), (2) manage the Synology NAS (files, packages, Docker, backups, Surveillance Station), (3) troubleshoot network connectivity or DNS, (4) check Tailscale status or manage the tailnet, (5) transfer files between machines, (6) check device health or disk usage, (7) manage the Caddy reverse proxy on dobro (*.hopperhosted.com), (8) any home server or home network administration task.","bodyPreview":"# Home Network Admin\n\nAdminister Tim''s home network: devices connected over Tailscale, with a Synology NAS and Macs accessible via SSH.\n\nRead [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full device list, IPs, SSH config, and network topology before performing any task.\n\n## SSH Access\n\nSSH configs are defined in `~/.ssh/config`. Use the short aliases:\n\n- `ssh synology` - Synology NAS (custom port, user tdhopper)\n- `ssh dobro` - Mac (default port, user thopper)\n\nSSH","body":"# Home Network Admin\n\nAdminister Tim''s home network: devices connected over Tailscale, with a Synology NAS and Macs accessible via SSH.\n\nRead [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full device list, IPs, SSH config, and network topology before performing any task.\n\n## SSH Access\n\nSSH configs are defined in `~/.ssh/config`. Use the short aliases:\n\n- `ssh synology` - Synology NAS (custom port, user tdhopper)\n- `ssh dobro` - Mac (default port, user thopper)\n\nSSH keys are managed via 1Password agent. If SSH fails with auth errors, verify 1Password is unlocked and the SSH agent is running.\n\n## Synology NAS Administration\n\nThe Synology runs DSM. Common admin tasks via SSH:\n\n- **Packages**: `synopkg list` (installed), `synopkg status <pkg>`, `synopkg start/stop <pkg>`\n- **Docker/Container Manager**: `sudo docker ps`, `sudo docker logs <container>`, `sudo docker compose` (compose files often in `/volume1/docker/`)\n- **Disk/volume health**: `df -h`, `cat /proc/mdstat`, `synodisk --enum`\n- **Shared folders**: typically under `/volume1/`\n- **DSM web UI**: `https://synology:5001` or `https://100.86.145.18:5001`\n- **Logs**: `/var/log/` and DSM log center\n\nFor destructive operations (deleting files, stopping services, modifying configs), confirm with the user first.\n\n## Tailscale\n\nTailscale connects all devices over a WireGuard mesh. Run `tailscale status` to discover the tailnet name and device list.\n\n- On macOS, the `tailscale` CLI may not be on PATH. Use: `/Applications/Tailscale.app/Contents/MacOS/Tailscale`\n- Check status: `tailscale status` (or the full path above)\n- Verify connectivity: `tailscale ping <hostname>`\n- All devices are reachable via MagicDNS (e.g., `synology.<tailnet>.ts.net`)\n\n## Caddy Reverse Proxy (on dobro)\n\nCaddy runs on dobro, providing HTTPS reverse proxy for `*.hopperhosted.com`. The Caddyfile is at `~/Caddyfile` (tracked in yadm). TLS uses Cloudflare DNS-01 challenge.\n\nSee [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full list of proxied subdomains and backends.\n\n- **Manage Caddy on dobro**: `ssh dobro` then `brew services restart caddy`, `caddy reload --config ~/Caddyfile`\n- **Logs**: `journalctl -u caddy` or `brew services info caddy` depending on how it''s managed\n- **Edit Caddyfile locally**: it''s tracked in yadm dotfiles at `~/Caddyfile`\n\n## File Transfer\n\n- Between local and remote hosts: `scp` or `rsync` using the SSH aliases\n- Example: `rsync -avz ~/files/ synology:/volume1/backup/files/`\n- For large transfers, prefer `rsync` with `--progress`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n1. **Can''t SSH**: Check 1Password is unlocked, verify Tailscale is connected (`tailscale status`), ping the Tailscale IP\n2. **DNS issues**: Check if MagicDNS resolves (`dig @100.100.100.100 synology.<tailnet>.ts.net`), fall back to Tailscale IPs directly\n3. **NAS unresponsive**: Try ping, check DSM web UI, SSH may still work even if DSM is sluggish\n4. **Slow network**: Check if traffic is going through Tailscale relay (`tailscale status` shows DERP relay vs direct connection)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:25:43.931Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Network Administration Agents requiring secure SSH access and Tailscale device management.","zh":"适用于需要安全SSH访问和Tailscale设备管理的网络管理代理。","ja":"ネットワーク管理エージェントが安全なSSHアクセスとTailscaleデバイス管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"안전한 SSH 액세스 및 Tailscale 장치 관리가 필요한 네트워크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Administración de Red que requieren acceso SSH seguro y administración de dispositivos Tailscale.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''administration réseau nécessitant un accès SSH sécurisé et une gestion de périphériques Tailscale.","de":"Ideal für Netzwerk-Administrations-Agents, die sicheren SSH-Zugriff und Tailscale-Geräteverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Administração de Rede que requerem acesso SSH seguro e gerenciamento de dispositivos Tailscale.","ru":"Идеально для агентов сетевой администрации, требующих безопасного доступа SSH и управления устройствами Tailscale.","ar":"يستخدم Agentes de Administração de Rede que requirem acesso SSH seguro e gerenciamento de dispositivos Tailscale."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage home networks via SSH, leveraging Tailscale for secure device connections, and interacting with Synology NAS and Mac devices using custom SSH configs and aliases like ''ssh synology'' and ''ssh dobro'', while utilizing network topology information from references like ''network-inventory.md''.","zh":"赋予代理通过SSH管理家庭网络的能力，利用Tailscale进行安全的设备连接，并使用自定义的SSH配置和别名（如''ssh synology''和''ssh dobro''）与Synology NAS和Mac设备进行交互，同时利用''network-inventory.md''中的网络拓扑信息。","ja":"エージェントがSSHを介してホームネットワークを管理できるようにし、Tailscaleを使用して安全なデバイス接続を実現し、カスタムSSH構成とエイリアス（例：''ssh synology''および''ssh dobro''）を使用してSynology NASおよびMacデバイスとやり取りし、''network-inventory.md''からのネットワークトポロジ情報を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 SSH를 통해 홈 네트워크를 관리할 수 있도록 하고, Tailscale을 사용하여 안전한 장치 연결을 제공하며, 사용자 지정 SSH 구성 및 별칭(''ssh synology'' 및 ''ssh dobro'' 등)을 사용하여 Synology NAS 및 Mac 장치와 상호 작용하며, ''network-inventory.md''에서 제공하는 네트워크 토폴로지 정보를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar redes domésticas a través de SSH, aprovechando Tailscale para conexiones de dispositivos seguras, e interactuando con dispositivos Synology NAS y Mac mediante configuraciones SSH personalizadas y alias como ''ssh synology'' y ''ssh dobro'', mientras se utilizan información de topología de red de referencias como ''network-inventory.md''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les réseaux domestiques via SSH, en exploitant Tailscale pour des connexions de périphériques sécurisées, et en interagissant avec les appareils Synology NAS et Mac à l''aide de configurations SSH personnalisées et d''alias tels que ''ssh synology'' et ''ssh dobro'', tout en utilisant les informations de topologie réseau à partir de références comme ''network-inventory.md''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Heimnetzwerke über SSH zu verwalten, indem Tailscale für sichere Geräteverbindungen genutzt wird, und mit Synology NAS- und Mac-Geräten über benutzerdefinierte SSH-Konfigurationen und Aliase wie ''ssh synology'' und ''ssh dobro'' interagiert, während Netzwerktopologie-Informationen aus Referenzen wie ''network-inventory.md'' genutzt werden.","pt":"Empowers os agentes a gerenciar redes domésticas via SSH, utilizando Tailscale para conexões de dispositivos seguras, e interagindo com dispositivos Synology NAS e Mac usando configurações SSH personalizadas e aliases como ''ssh synology'' e ''ssh dobro'', enquanto utiliza informações de topologia de rede de referências como ''network-inventory.md''.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять домашними сетями через SSH, используя Tailscale для безопасных подключений устройств, и взаимодействуя с устройствами Synology NAS и Mac с помощью пользовательских конфигураций SSH и алиасов как ''ssh synology'' и ''ssh dobro'', при этом используя информацию о топологии сети из ссылок как ''network-inventory.md''.","ar":"Empowers os agentes a gerenciar redes domésticas via SSH, utilizando Tailscale para conexões de dispositivos seguras, e interagindo com dispositivos Synology NAS e Mac usando configurações SSH personalizadas e aliases como ''ssh synology'' e ''ssh dobro'', enquanto utiliza informações de topologia de rede de referências como ''network-inventory.md''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SSH connections to Synology NAS and Mac devices","Managing network devices connected over Tailscale","Debugging network topology issues using inventory data from ''network-inventory.md''"],"zh":["自动化Synology NAS和Mac设备的SSH连接","管理通过Tailscale连接的网络设备","使用''network-inventory.md''中的库存数据调试网络拓扑问题"],"ja":["Synology NASおよびMacデバイスへのSSH接続を自動化する","Tailscaleを介して接続されたネットワークデバイスを管理する","''network-inventory.md''からのインベントリデータを使用してネットワークトポロジの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Synology NAS 및 Mac 장치에 대한 SSH 연결 자동화","Tailscale을 통해 연결된 네트워크 장치를 관리하는 것","''network-inventory.md''에서 제공하는 인벤토리 데이터를 사용하여 네트워크 토폴로지 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar conexiones SSH a dispositivos Synology NAS y Mac","Administrar dispositivos de red conectados a través de Tailscale","Depurar problemas de topología de red utilizando datos de inventario de ''network-inventory.md''"],"fr":["Automatiser les connexions SSH aux appareils Synology NAS et Mac","Gérer les périphériques réseau connectés via Tailscale","Déboguer les problèmes de topologie réseau en utilisant les données d''inventaire de ''network-inventory.md''"],"de":["Automatisieren von SSH-Verbindungen zu Synology NAS- und Mac-Geräten","Verwalten von Netzwerkgeräten, die über Tailscale verbunden sind","Fehlerbehebung bei Netzwerktopologieproblemen unter Verwendung von Inventardaten aus ''network-inventory.md''"],"pt":["Automar conexões SSH a dispositivos Synology NAS e Mac","Gerenciar dispositivos de rede conectados sobre Tailscale","Debugar problemas de topologia de rede usando dados de inventário de ''network-inventory.md''"],"ru":["Автоматизировать подключения SSH к устройствам Synology NAS и Mac","Управлять устройствами сети, подключенными через Tailscale","Отладить проблемы с топологией сети, используя данные инвентаря из ''network-inventory.md''"],"ar":["Automar conexões SSH a dispositivos Synology NAS e Mac","Gerenciar dispositivos de rede conectados sobre Tailscale","Debugar problemas de topologia de rede usando dados de inventário de ''network-inventory.md''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SSH access and configuration","Specific to Tailscale and Synology NAS environments","Needs ''network-inventory.md'' for device list and network topology"],"zh":["需要SSH访问和配置","仅限Tailscale和Synology NAS环境","需要''network-inventory.md''以获取设备列表和网络拓扑"],"ja":["SSHアクセスおよび構成が必要","TailscaleおよびSynology NAS環境に限定される","''network-inventory.md''がデバイスリストおよびネットワークトポロジを取得するために必要"],"ko":["SSH 액세스 및 구성이 필요합니다","Tailscale 및 Synology NAS 환경에서만 사용할 수 있습니다","''network-inventory.md''가 장치 목록 및 네트워크 토폴로지를 가져오는 데 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso y configuración SSH","Específico para entornos Tailscale y Synology NAS","Necesita ''network-inventory.md'' para la lista de dispositivos y la topología de red"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et une configuration SSH","Spécifique aux environnements Tailscale et Synology NAS","Nécessite ''network-inventory.md'' pour la liste des périphériques et la topologie réseau"],"de":["Benötigt SSH-Zugriff und -Konfiguration","Spezifisch für Tailscale- und Synology NAS-Umgebungen","Benötigt ''network-inventory.md'' für die Geräteliste und die Netzwerktopologie"],"pt":["Requer acesso SSH e configuração","Específico para ambientes Tailscale e Synology NAS","Necessita de ''network-inventory.md'' para lista de dispositivos e topologia de rede"],"ru":["Требует доступа SSH и конфигурации","Специфичный для сред Tailscale и Synology NAS","Нуждается в ''network-inventory.md'' для списка устройств и топологии сети"],"ar":["Requer acesso SSH e configuração","Específico para ambientes Tailscale e Synology NAS","Necessita de ''network-inventory.md'' para lista de dispositivos e topologia de rede"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"940c37ccc250d8b3a492c61a9176f008c87ab0cc36a4a91733859600b11e5789","qualityScore":15}');
