Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit dem Atlan-SDK","Integration mit KI-Tool-Agenten","Codebeispiele für Entwickler"],"pt":["Conectores SQL personalizados","Integração com aplicativos de exemplo","Suporte a bancos de dados múltiplos","Ferramentas de IA para otimização de consultas","Documentação detalhada para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Пользовательские коннекторы SQL","Интеграция с примерными aplikatsiyami","Поддержка нескольких баз данных","ИИ инструменты для оптимизации запросов","Дetailed документация для разработчиков"],"ar":["موصلات SQL مخصصة","التكامل مع تطبيقات عينة","دعم قواعد بيانات متعددة","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لتحسين الاستفسارات","توثيق مفصل للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Atlan SQL 连接器模式","AI 工具","Atlan 应用程序 SDK","SQL 连接器模式","示例应用","如何使用 Atlan","Atlan 安装","Atlan 设置指南"],"ja":["Atlan SQL コネクタ パターン","AI エージェント","Atlan Application SDK","SQL コネクタ パターン","サンプル アプリケーション","Atlan の使用方法","Atlan インストール","Atlan セットアップ ガイド"],"ko":["Atlan SQL 커넥터 패턴","AI 에이전트","Atlan Application SDK","SQL 커넥터 패턴","샘플 애플리케이션","Atlan 사용 방법","Atlan 설치","Atlan 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de agente de IA","patrones de conector SQL","SDK de Atlan","desarrollo de aplicaciones","integración de bases de datos","cómo usar Atlan","alternativas a Atlan","guía de instalación de Atlan"],"fr":["outils d''agent IA","modèles de connecteur SQL","SDK Atlan","développement d''applications","intégration de bases de données","comment utiliser Atlan","alternatives à Atlan","guide d''installation Atlan"],"de":["KI-Tool-Agenten","SQL-Connector-Muster","Atlan-SDK","Anwendungsentwicklung","Datenbankintegration","wie man Atlan verwendet","Alternativen zu Atlan","Installationsanleitung Atlan"],"pt":["conectores SQL Atlan","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","como usar conectores SQL","alternativas para conectores SQL","guia de instalação do conector SQL Atlan","configuração do conector SQL Atlan","otimização de consultas com IA"],"ru":["коннекторы SQL Atlan","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","как использовать коннекторы SQL","альтернативы коннекторам SQL","руководство по установке коннектора SQL Atlan","настройка коннектора SQL Atlan","оптимизация запросов с ИИ"],"ar":["موصلات SQL Atlan","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام موصلات SQL","بديلات لموصلات SQL","دليل تثبيت موصل SQL Atlan","إعداد موصل SQL Atlan","تحسين الاستفسارات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"atlanhq","repo":"atlan-sample-apps","repoPath":"atlanhq/atlan-sample-apps","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.707Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"atlan-sql-connector-patterns","description":"Select and apply the correct SQL connector implementation pattern (SDK-default minimal or source-specific custom). Use when building or extending SQL metadata/query extraction connectors.","bodyPreview":"# Atlan SQL Connector Patterns\n\nChoose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Use `references/decision-tree.md` to choose `postgres-minimal` or `redshift-custom`.\n2. Implement required components for selected path.\n3. Verify auth, preflight, workflow map, and transformation behavior against references.\n4. Run `atlan-fact-verification-gate` if requirements imply source-specific behavior or SDK override risk.\n5. Hand off to `atlan-e2e-contract-validator` for co","body":"# Atlan SQL Connector Patterns\n\nChoose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Use `references/decision-tree.md` to choose `postgres-minimal` or `redshift-custom`.\n2. Implement required components for selected path.\n3. Verify auth, preflight, workflow map, and transformation behavior against references.\n4. Run `atlan-fact-verification-gate` if requirements imply source-specific behavior or SDK override risk.\n5. Hand off to `atlan-e2e-contract-validator` for contract generation.\n\n## Rules\n- Default to minimal path unless requirements justify custom path.\n- For custom path, explicitly document why SDK defaults are insufficient.\n- Reuse source-specific patterns only when corresponding requirements are present.\n\n## References\n- Decision tree: `references/decision-tree.md`\n- Shared verification map: `../_shared/references/verification-sources.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:16.884Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Integration Agents needing standardized SQL connector patterns for Postgres and Redshift databases.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化SQL连接器模式的Postgres和Redshift数据库的数据集成代理。","ja":"PostgresおよびRedshiftデータベースの標準化されたSQLコネクタパターンを必要とするデータ統合エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Postgres 및 Redshift 데이터베이스의 표준화된 SQL 커넥터 패턴이 필요한 데이터 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de integración de datos que necesitan patrones de conectores SQL estandarizados para bases de datos Postgres y Redshift.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intégration de données ayant besoin de modèles de connecteurs SQL standardisés pour les bases de données Postgres et Redshift.","de":"Perfekt für Data Integration Agents, die standardisierte SQL-Connector-Muster für Postgres- und Redshift-Datenbanken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração de Dados que necessitam de padrões de conector SQL padrão para bancos de dados Postgres e Redshift.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции данных, которым требуются стандартизированные шаблоны коннекторов SQL для баз данных Postgres и Redshift.","ar":"مثالي لعميل دمج البيانات الذي يحتاج إلى أنماط موصل SQL معيارية لبيانات قواعد Postgres و Redshift."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement consistent connector strategies using Atlan Application SDK, ensuring auth, preflight, and transformation behavior verification against references, and leveraging protocols like postgres-minimal and redshift-custom.","zh":"赋予代理实现一致的连接器策略的能力，使用Atlan Application SDK，确保身份验证、预检和转换行为验证与参考值一致，并利用像postgres-minimal和redshift-custom这样的协议。","ja":"Atlan Application SDKを使用して、エージェントが一貫したコネクタ戦略を実装する能力を提供し、認証、事前フライト、および変換動作の検証を参照値と一致させ、postgres-minimalやredshift-customなどのプロトコルを活用します。","ko":"Atlan Application SDK를 사용하여 에이전트가 일관된 커넥터 전략을 구현할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 인증, 사전 비행 및 변환 동작을 참조 값과 일치시키고 postgres-minimal 및 redshift-custom와 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar estrategias de conectores coherentes utilizando el SDK de aplicaciones Atlan, asegurando la autenticación, preflight y la verificación del comportamiento de transformación frente a referencias, y aprovechando protocolos como postgres-minimal y redshift-custom.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de connecteurs cohérentes en utilisant le SDK d''applications Atlan, en garantissant l''authentification, le prévol et la vérification du comportement de transformation par rapport aux références, et en exploitant des protocoles tels que postgres-minimal et redshift-custom.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, konsistente Connector-Strategien mithilfe des Atlan Application SDK umzusetzen, indem Authentifizierung, Preflight und Transformationsverhaltensüberprüfung gegen Referenzen sichergestellt werden und Protokolle wie postgres-minimal und redshift-custom genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a implementar estratégias de conector consistentes usando Atlan Application SDK, garantindo autenticação, pré-voo e verificação de comportamento de transformação contra referências, e aproveitando protocolos como postgres-minimal e redshift-custom.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать последовательные стратегии коннекторов с использованием Atlan Application SDK, обеспечивая аутентификацию, предварительный полет и проверку поведения трансформации против ссылок, и использует протоколы, такие как postgres-minimal и redshift-custom.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تنفيذ استراتيجيات الموصل المتسقة باستخدام Atlan Application SDK، وضمان التحقق من سلوك التحويل والمصادقة والطيران المسبق مقابل المراجع، وتحقيق البروتوكولات مثل postgres-minimal و redshift-custom."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing postgres-minimal connector for minimal database interactions","Configuring redshift-custom connector for customized data workflows","Verifying connector behavior against Atlan references and SDK overrides"],"zh":["实现postgres-minimal连接器以进行最小的数据库交互","配置redshift-custom连接器以进行自定义数据工作流","验证连接器行为与Atlan参考值和SDK重写"],"ja":["最小限のデータベースのやり取りのためのpostgres-minimalコネクタの実装","カスタマイズされたデータワークフローに対するredshift-customコネクタの構成","AtlanのリファレンスとSDKのオーバーライドに対するコネクタ動作の検証"],"ko":["최소한의 데이터베이스 상호 작용을 위한 postgres-minimal 커넥터 구현","사용자 정의 데이터 워크플로우를 위한 redshift-custom 커넥터 구성","Atlan 참조 및 SDK 오버라이드에 대한 커넥터 동작 확인"],"es":["Implementar conector postgres-minimal para interacciones de base de datos mínimas","Configurar conector redshift-custom para flujos de datos personalizados","Verificar el comportamiento del conector frente a referencias y SDK de Atlan"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le connecteur postgres-minimal pour des interactions de base de données minimales","Configurer le connecteur redshift-custom pour des flux de données personnalisés","Vérifier le comportement du connecteur par rapport aux références et au SDK d''Atlan"],"de":["Implementierung des postgres-minimal-Connectors für minimale Datenbankinteraktionen","Konfiguration des redshift-custom-Connectors für benutzerdefinierte Datenworkflows","Überprüfung des Connector-Verhaltens gegen Atlan-Referenzen und SDK-Überschreibungen"],"pt":["Implementação do conector postgres-minimal para interações de banco de dados mínimas","Configuração do conector redshift-custom para fluxos de trabalho de dados personalizados","Verificação do comportamento do conector contra referências Atlan e SDK overrides"],"ru":["Реализация коннектора postgres-minimal для минимальных взаимодействий с базой данных","Настройка коннектора redshift-custom для настраиваемых рабочих процессов данных","Проверка поведения коннектора против ссылок Atlan и SDK переопределений"],"ar":["تنفيذ موصل postgres-minimal للتفاعلات القصوى مع قاعدة البيانات","تكوين موصل redshift-custom للتدفقات العملية البيانية المخصصة","التحقق من سلوك الموصل مقابل المراجع Atlan و SDK overrides"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Atlan Application SDK","Limited to Postgres and Redshift databases","Needs atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator for thorough validation"],"zh":["需要Atlan Application SDK","仅限Postgres和Redshift数据库","需要atlan-fact-verification-gate和atlan-e2e-contract-validator进行彻底的验证"],"ja":["Atlan Application SDKが必要","PostgresおよびRedshiftデータベースのみ","atlan-fact-verification-gateおよびatlan-e2e-contract-validatorが必要な徹底的な検証"],"ko":["Atlan Application SDK가 필요합니다.","Postgres 및 Redshift 데이터베이스만 해당","彻底한 확인을 위해 atlan-fact-verification-gate 및 atlan-e2e-contract-validator가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Atlan Application SDK","Limitado a bases de datos Postgres y Redshift","Necesita atlan-fact-verification-gate y atlan-e2e-contract-validator para una validación exhaustiva"],"fr":["Nécessite le SDK d''applications Atlan","Limité aux bases de données Postgres et Redshift","Nécessite atlan-fact-verification-gate et atlan-e2e-contract-validator pour une validation approfondie"],"de":["Benötigt Atlan Application SDK","Begrenzt auf Postgres- und Redshift-Datenbanken","Benötigt atlan-fact-verification-gate und atlan-e2e-contract-validator für eine umfassende Überprüfung"],"pt":["Exige Atlan Application SDK","Limitado a bancos de dados Postgres e Redshift","Necessita atlan-fact-verification-gate e atlan-e2e-contract-validator para validação completa"],"ru":["Требует Atlan Application SDK","Ограничен базами данных Postgres и Redshift","Требует atlan-fact-verification-gate и atlan-e2e-contract-validator для полной проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب Atlan Application SDK","محدود بقواعد البيانات Postgres و Redshift","يحتاج إلى atlan-fact-verification-gate و atlan-e2e-contract-validator للتحقق الشامل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"89e1e1206f17a7bc4b2259f7f3ee8662588affd482af92b71d2ef1ab13200873","qualityScore":15}');
