s-lookup-data","guía de configuración de infoproviders-lookup-data"," qué es infoproviders-lookup-data","usando infoproviders-lookup-data para informes de impuestos"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les taxes","comment générer des rapports de taxes","infoproviders-lookup-data alternative","rapports de taxes pour la France","installation d''infoproviders-lookup-data","guide de configuration d''infoproviders-lookup-data","qu''est-ce que infoproviders-lookup-data","utilisation d''infoproviders-lookup-data pour les rapports de taxes"],"de":["KI-Tools für Steuern","wie man Steuererklärungen erstellt","infoproviders-lookup-data Alternative","Steuereklärungen für Deutschland","Installation von infoproviders-lookup-data","Einrichtungsanleitung für infoproviders-lookup-data","was ist infoproviders-lookup-data","Verwendung von infoproviders-lookup-data für Steuererklärungen"],"pt":["ferramentas de ai","relatórios de impostos","autoridade fiscal","declaração de impostos","infoproviders-lookup-data","como usar infoproviders-lookup-data","o que é infoproviders-lookup-data"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","налоговые отчеты","налоговые органы","подача налоговой декларации","infoproviders-lookup-data","как использовать infoproviders-lookup-data","что такое infoproviders-lookup-data"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقرير ضريبة","سلطات الضرائب","الإقرار الضريبي","infoproviders-lookup-data","كيفية استخدام infoproviders-lookup-data","ما هو infoproviders-lookup-data"]}},"owner":"MarjanDB","repo":"brrr-generator","repoPath":"MarjanDB/brrr-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T01:52:08.965Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"infoproviders-lookup-data","description":"When and how to edit InfoProviders lookup JSONs (company, country, treaty, ISIN). Use when fixing Failed processing stock lot, wrong country or company data, or adding fallbacks for unresolved identifiers.","bodyPreview":"# InfoProviders and lookup data\n\nGeneric guidance for `src/InfoProviders/` and the JSON lookup files. Country-specific use (e.g. treaty format) may be documented in a tax-authority skill.\n\n## Where lookups are used\n\n- **CompanyLookupProvider** – Resolves ISIN to company info (name, address, country). Tries online lookup first; falls back to **missingCompaniesLookup.json** and **missingISINLookup.json**.\n- **CountryLookupProvider** – Resolves country name to 2-letter code and treaty info. Uses **","body":"# InfoProviders and lookup data\n\nGeneric guidance for `src/InfoProviders/` and the JSON lookup files. Country-specific use (e.g. treaty format) may be documented in a tax-authority skill.\n\n## Where lookups are used\n\n- **CompanyLookupProvider** – Resolves ISIN to company info (name, address, country). Tries online lookup first; falls back to **missingCompaniesLookup.json** and **missingISINLookup.json**.\n- **CountryLookupProvider** – Resolves country name to 2-letter code and treaty info. Uses **internationalTreaties.json** and **specialCountryMappings.json**.\n\nTax authority report generation and staging processors use these when annotating events (e.g. company domicile, treaty relief).\n\n## When to edit which file\n\n| Symptom                                                      | Likely fix                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **\"Failed processing stock lot\"** or \"Failed lookup of ISIN\" | Lot or event has an identifier (ISIN/ticker) the pipeline can’t resolve. Add or correct an entry in **missingISINLookup.json** (ISIN → ticker for online lookup) or **missingCompaniesLookup.json** (ISIN → full company object for offline fallback). |\n| Wrong or missing **company** name/address                    | Add or update entry in **missingCompaniesLookup.json** for that identifier (e.g. ISIN).                                                                                                                                                                |\n| Online lookup fails for a known ISIN/ticker                  | Add **missingISINLookup.json** entry: key = ISIN, value = ticker symbol used by the lookup service (e.g. for yfinance).                                                                                                                                |\n| Wrong **country** code or unknown country name               | Add or update **specialCountryMappings.json**: key = country name as in broker/data, value = 2-letter ISO code.                                                                                                                                        |\n| **Treaty** reference (e.g. tax relief) for a country         | Add or update **internationalTreaties.json** under the structure used by CountryLookupProvider (e.g. treaties by country code). Exact key/value format is defined by the tax authority; see country-specific skill if applicable.                      |\n\n## File formats (generic)\n\n- **missingISINLookup.json** – Object: identifier (e.g. ISIN) → string (e.g. ticker). Used when resolution by identifier fails so the provider can try again with the mapped value.\n- **missingCompaniesLookup.json** – Object: identifier (e.g. ISIN) → company object. Company object typically has fields such as shortName, longName, address1, address2, city, zip, country (and optionally state). Used when no online company data is available.\n- **specialCountryMappings.json** – Object: country name (as in data) → 2-letter country code. Overrides default country resolution.\n- **internationalTreaties.json** – Nested structure (e.g. treaties.taxRelief) keyed by country code; values are treaty references. Structure and semantics depend on the tax authority; see country skill for details.\n\nAll paths are under `src/InfoProviders/`. After editing, re-run the pipeline; no separate reload step is required.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T03:18:50.286Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Tax Compliance Agents requiring accurate brokerage account tax report generation for various countries","zh":"适用于需要为各个国家生成准确的券商账户税务报告的税务合规代理","ja":"税務報告書の正確な生成が必要な税金遵守エージェントに最適","ko":"각국에 대한 정확한 증권 계좌税 보고서 생성이 필요한 税務준수 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de cumplimiento fiscal que requieren la generación precisa de informes de impuestos de cuentas de corretaje para varios países","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conformité fiscale nécessitant la génération précise de rapports d''impôt de comptes de courtage pour divers pays","de":"Ideal für Steuereinhaltungssachbearbeiter, die eine genaue Erstellung von Steuererklärungen für Wertpapierkonten in verschiedenen Ländern benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conformidade Fiscal que exigem geração precisa de relatórios de impostos de contas de corretagem para vários países","ru":"Идеально для агентов налогового соответствия, требующих точной генерации отчетов о налогах на брокерские счета для различных стран","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الامتثال الضريبي الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تقارير دقيقة للضريبة على حسابات الوساطة المالية في بلدان مختلفة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to resolve ISIN to company information and country names to 2-letter codes and treaty details using JSON lookup files like missingCompaniesLookup.json and missingISINLookup.json, facilitating comprehensive tax reporting","zh":"赋予代理人使用JSON查找文件（如missingCompaniesLookup.json和missingISINLookup.json）解析ISIN到公司信息和国家名称到2字母代码及税约详情，从而实现全面税务报告","ja":"JSONルックアップファイル（例：missingCompaniesLookup.jsonおよびmissingISINLookup.json）を使用して、ISINを会社情報に、国名を2文字のコードおよび税条約の詳細に解決し、包括的な税務報告書を容易にする","ko":"JSON 조회 파일(missingCompaniesLookup.json 및 missingISINLookup.json)을 사용하여 ISIN을 회사 정보로, 국가 이름을 2자리 코드 및 조세 조약 세부 정보로 해결하여 포괄적인 税務보고를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver el ISIN a información de la empresa y los nombres de los países a códigos de 2 letras y detalles de tratados utilizando archivos de búsqueda JSON como missingCompaniesLookup.json y missingISINLookup.json, lo que facilita la presentación de informes de impuestos integrales","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre l''ISIN en informations d''entreprise et les noms de pays en codes à 2 lettres et détails de traités en utilisant des fichiers de recherche JSON tels que missingCompaniesLookup.json et missingISINLookup.json, facilitant ainsi la présentation de rapports d''impôt complets","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ISIN zu Unternehmensinformationen und Ländernamen zu 2-Buchstaben-Codes und Vertragdetails mithilfe von JSON-Suchdateien wie missingCompaniesLookup.json und missingISINLookup.json aufzulösen, wodurch umfassende Steuererklärungen erleichtert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver ISIN para informações da empresa e nomes de países para códigos de duas letras e detalhes de tratado usando arquivos de pesquisa JSON como missingCompaniesLookup.json e missingISINLookup.json, facilitando a elaboração de relatórios fiscais abrangentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрешать ISIN в информацию о компании и названия стран в двухбуквенные коды и подробности о договоре с помощью файлов поиска JSON, таких как missingCompaniesLookup.json и missingISINLookup.json, облегчая всестороннее налоговое отчетность","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من حل ISIN إلى معلومات الشركة وأسماء البلدان إلى رموز مكونة من حرفين وتفاصيل الاتفاقية باستخدام ملفات البحث JSON مثل missingCompaniesLookup.json و missingISINLookup.json، وتسهيل تقديم تقارير ضريبية شاملة"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating tax reports for brokerage accounts","Resolving company information from ISIN codes","Determining country-specific treaty formats for tax compliance"],"zh":["为券商账户生成税务报告","从ISIN代码解析公司信息","确定国家特定税务约定格式以遵守税务法规"],"ja":["証券口座の税務報告書の生成","ISINコードから会社情報を解決","税務遵守のための国特有の税条約形式の決定"],"ko":["증권 계좌의 税務보고서 생성","ISIN 코드로부터 회사 정보를 해결","税務준수를 위한 국가별 조세 조약 형식의 결정"],"es":["Generación de informes de impuestos para cuentas de corretaje","Resolución de información de la empresa a partir de códigos ISIN","Determinación de formatos de tratados específicos del país para el cumplimiento fiscal"],"fr":["Génération de rapports d''impôt pour les comptes de courtage","Résolution des informations d''entreprise à partir de codes ISIN","Détermination des formats de traités spécifiques au pays pour la conformité fiscale"],"de":["Erstellung von Steuererklärungen für Wertpapierkonten","Auflösung von Unternehmensinformationen aus ISIN-Codes","Bestimmung von länderspezifischen Vertragsformaten für die Steuereinhaltung"],"pt":["Geração de relatórios de impostos para contas de corretagem","Resolução de informações da empresa a partir de códigos ISIN","Determinação de formatos de tratados específicos do país para conformidade fiscal"],"ru":["Генерация отчетов о налогах на брокерские счета","Разрешение информации о компании из кодов ISIN","Определение форматов договоров, специфичных для страны, для налогового соответствия"],"ar":["توليد تقارير الضريبة على حسابات الوساطة المالية","حل معلومات الشركة من رموز ISIN","تحديد تنسيقات الاتفاقيات المحددة للبلد للامتثال الضريبي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to country-specific tax authority documentation","Dependent on online lookup services for company and country data","Fallback to local JSON files for missing data"],"zh":["需要访问国家特定税务机关文档","依赖在线查找服务以获取公司和国家数据","对于缺失数据，回退到本地JSON文件"],"ja":["国特有の税務当局の文書へのアクセスが必要","会社および国データの取得のためのオンラインルックアップサービスに依存","データが不足している場合はローカルJSONファイルにフォールバック"],"ko":["국가별 세무 당국 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요","회사 및 국가 데이터를 가져오기 위한 온라인 조회 서비스에 의존","데이터가不足할 경우 로컬 JSON 파일로 폴백"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de la autoridad fiscal del país","Dependiente de servicios de búsqueda en línea para datos de empresas y países","Resume a archivos JSON locales para datos que faltan"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de l''autorité fiscale du pays","Dépendante de services de recherche en ligne pour les données d''entreprises et de pays","Recul à des fichiers JSON locaux pour les données manquantes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dokumentation der länderspezifischen Steuerbehörde","Abhängig von Online-Suchdiensten für Unternehmens- und Länderdaten","Fällt auf lokale JSON-Dateien für fehlende Daten zurück"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação da autoridade fiscal específica do país","Dependente de serviços de pesquisa online para dados da empresa e do país","Recorrência a arquivos JSON locais para dados ausentes"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации налоговых органов страны","Зависит от онлайн-сервисов поиска для данных о компании и стране","Переход к локальным файлам JSON для отсутствующих данных"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق السلطة الضريبية المحددة للبلد","يعتمد على خدمات البحث عبر الإنترنت للبيانات الشركة والبلد","الاحتياطي إلى ملفات JSON المحلية للبيانات المفقودة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8208cc17f7fc5962f2adce7cff90decf6a291fe75c888705a7f26893ef57d702","qualityScore":15}');
