sualizaciones"],"fr":["Notation de santé de compte en temps réel","Analyse de données de compte avec Outils d''IA","Identification des risques et des opportunités","Intégration avec des outils de gestion de comptes","Rapports personnalisés et visualisations"],"de":["Echtzeit-Kontogesundheitsbewertung","Datenanalyse von Konten mit KI-Agents","Risiken- und Chancenidentifizierung","Integration mit Kontenmanagement-Tools","Individuelle Berichte und Visualisierungen"],"pt":["Análise de dados de conta com Ferramentas de IA","Pontuação de saúde de conta personalizada","Integração com o Context OS","Suporte a múltiplas contas","Relatórios detalhados de saúde de conta"],"ru":["Анализ данных аккаунта с помощью ИИ Агентов","Индивидуальная оценка здоровья аккаунта","Интеграция с Context OS","Поддержка нескольких аккаунтов","Детальные отчеты о здоровье аккаунта"],"ar":["تحليل بيانات الحساب باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقييم صحة الحساب المخصص","التكامل مع Context OS","دعم حسابات متعددة","تقارير مفصلة عن صحة الحساب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","账户健康评分","Context OS","AI工具","如何使用AI智能体","AI智能体安装","AI智能体设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","アカウントヘルススコアリング","Context OS","AIツール","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","계정 건강 점수","Context OS","AI 도구","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar Agentes de IA","qué es la puntuación de salud de cuenta","herramientas de gestión de cuentas","Agentes de IA alternativos","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA","mejora de la salud de la cuenta"],"fr":["comment utiliser des Outils d''IA","quoi est la notation de santé de compte","outils de gestion de comptes","Outils d''IA alternatifs","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration d''Outils d''IA","amélioration de la santé du compte"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist die Kontogesundheitsbewertung","Kontenmanagement-Tools","KI-Agents-Alternativen","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents","Verbesserung der Kontogesundheit"],"pt":["pontuação de saúde de conta","ferramentas de ia","context os","saúde de conta","análise de dados","relatórios de saúde de conta","como melhorar a saúde da conta","alternativas ao context os","configuração do context os"],"ru":["оценка здоровья аккаунта","ии агенты","context os","здоровье аккаунта","анализ данных","отчеты о здоровье аккаунта","как улучшить здоровье аккаунта","альтернативы context os","установка context os"],"ar":["تقييم صحة الحساب","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","context os","صحة الحساب","تحليل البيانات","تقارير صحة الحساب","كيفية تحسين صحة الحساب","بديل لبرنامج context os","تثبيت برنامج context os"]}},"owner":"growthxai","repo":"context-os-starterkit","repoPath":"growthxai/context-os-starterkit","stars":1,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T08:17:05Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"account-health-scoring","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Account Health Scoring\n\nScore a GrowthX client account 1-5 on 5 dimensions using Andi''s rubric, compare against EM self-reported scores, flag misalignment. Compact scorecard (~1,000-1,500 words), not a narrative report.\n\n## Architecture: Sequential Data Gathering\n\nData gathering is **heavy** — Fireflies transcripts, Slack history, and Notion pages can each be large. Gather each source sequentially, extracting only the relevant signals before moving on. Never dump raw transcripts or message his","body":"# Account Health Scoring\n\nScore a GrowthX client account 1-5 on 5 dimensions using Andi''s rubric, compare against EM self-reported scores, flag misalignment. Compact scorecard (~1,000-1,500 words), not a narrative report.\n\n## Architecture: Sequential Data Gathering\n\nData gathering is **heavy** — Fireflies transcripts, Slack history, and Notion pages can each be large. Gather each source sequentially, extracting only the relevant signals before moving on. Never dump raw transcripts or message histories into the output — distill findings into structured evidence summaries.\n\n```\nWorkflow:\n  1. Clarify scope\n  2. Determine engagement stage (Notion)\n  3. Gather Fireflies evidence → extract structured summary\n  4. Gather Slack evidence → extract structured summary\n  5. Gather Notion evidence → extract structured summary\n  6. Assemble evidence buckets per dimension\n  7. Score each dimension against rubric\n  8. Compare, analyze, save\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1 — Clarify Scope\n\n1. Ask which client to score\n2. Resolve client slug for Slack channels (`#d-int-{clientslug}`, `#d-ext-{clientslug}`)\n3. Optionally ask if there''s a specific concern (does NOT override independence rule — all 5 dimensions still scored independently)\n\n### Step 2 — Determine Engagement Stage\n\nQuery Sprint Tracker (Notion DB `2102ba60-bc74-8058-b988-000b509f811f`) for the client.\n\n| Stage | Criteria | Performance/ROI Scoring |\n|-------|----------|------------------------|\n| SPRINT | Pre-Transition Date | Foundation-building |\n| NEW | 0-3 months since Transition Date | Foundation-building |\n| ESTABLISHED | 3+ months since Transition Date | Outcomes-based |\n\n### Step 3 — Gather Evidence (3 Sources, Sequential)\n\nFor each source, read the data-sources reference file first for extraction targets.\n\n**Reference file:** `references/data-sources.md`\n\n#### Source A — Fireflies\n\n1. Use Fireflies MCP tools to find all calls for this client from the last 60-90 days\n2. For each call, fetch the transcript and/or summary\n3. Tag each call with its date\n\nExtract a structured summary organized by dimension:\n\n- **Calls Found:** List each with title and date\n- **Evidence by Dimension:** Relationship, Quantity, Content Quality, Performance/ROI, Strategy — with specific signals and dates\n- **EM Assessment (Optional):** Questions asked, dimensions covered/missing, communication style\n- **Red Flags / Green Flags observed**\n\n#### Source B — Slack\n\nSearch these channels:\n1. `#d-int-{clientslug}` — last 60-90 days (internal)\n2. `#d-ext-{clientslug}` — last 60-90 days (external/client-facing)\n3. `#d-at-risk-alerts` — all time, filter for client name\n\nExtract structured summary:\n- **Channels Searched:** message count / date range per channel\n- **Evidence by Dimension:** with dates\n- **Key Signals:** silence periods, escalation threads, at-risk alerts, leadership messages\n- **EM Slack Behavior (Optional):** response frequency, follow-up patterns, proactive vs reactive\n- **Red Flags / Green Flags observed**\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Never quote DMs. Paraphrase only.\n\n#### Source C — Notion\n\nGather from 3 Notion sources:\n\n1. **ClientDB** — EM-reported health scores (all 5 dimensions), Health Flag, MRR, Renewal Date, Pod, EM, ME, historical scores\n2. **Sprint Tracker** (DB ID: `2102ba60-bc74-8058-b988-000b509f811f`) — Sprint Kickoff Date, Sprint Length, Transition Date, Sprint Status\n3. **Sync Notes** — last 60-90 days, key discussion points, client feedback, action items\n\nExtract structured summary:\n- **Account Metadata:** Client, Pod, EM, ME, MRR, Renewal, Health Flag\n- **EM-Reported Scores** (latest table)\n- **Historical Scores** if available\n- **Engagement Stage Data** with calculated stage\n- **Evidence by Dimension** from sync notes\n\n### Step 4 — Assemble Evidence Buckets\n\nCombine all structured summaries into **per-dimension buckets**:\n\n1. **Relationship** — Relationship sections from all 3 sources\n2. **Quantity** — Quantity sections from all 3 sources\n3. **Content Quality** — Content Quality sections from all 3 sources\n4. **Performance/ROI** — Performance sections + engagement stage\n5. **Strategy** — Strategy sections from all 3 sources\n6. **EM Assessment** (optional) — only if user requested\n\nAlso collect: red flags, green flags, data gaps, evidence source metadata.\n\n### Step 5 — Score Each Dimension\n\nRead `references/scoring-rubric.md` for full criteria, flags, and independence rules.\n\nScore in order: Relationship → Quantity → Content Quality → Performance/ROI → Strategy.\n\nFor each dimension:\n1. **Isolate** — use ONLY this dimension''s evidence bucket\n2. **Apply rubric** — map evidence to 1-5 criteria\n3. **Check flags** — identify red/green flags present\n4. **Recency weight** — apply exponential decay: weight = 2^(-days_ago / 14). 14-day half-life.\n5. **Score** — assign 1-5 with 1-2 sentence justification citing specific evidence\n6. **Self-check** — \"If I cover up all other scores, does THIS score still make sense based ONLY on THIS dimension''s criteria?\"\n7. **Confidence** — High (multiple recent sources) / Medium (1-2 sources or older data) / Low (minimal evidence)\n\nPerformance/ROI: use engagement stage (NEW = foundation criteria, ESTABLISHED = outcomes criteria).\n\n**After all 5 scored:** Check for halo/horn contamination — all scores identical or all moving same direction without dimension-specific justification → re-score affected dimensions.\n\n### Step 6 — Compare, Analyze, Save\n\nRead `assets/output-template.md` for the exact output format.\n\n1. **Retrieve prior agent scores:** Search `Reports/` for the most recent prior health score file for this client (pattern: `{Client_Name}_Health_Score_*.md`). Extract the previous agent scores per dimension.\n2. Build scorecard: Agent Score | EM Score | Gap for each dimension\n3. Flag misalignment where |Agent - EM| >= 2\n4. *(Optional)* Write EM Effectiveness Assessment if user requested\n5. List action triggers per rubric (score <= 2 → director ticket; drop >= 1 → flag; red flag → document). No added recommendations — just which thresholds fired.\n6. Document data gaps\n7. Save to `Reports/{Client_Name}_Health_Score_{YYYY-MM-DD}.md`\n\nRead `references/rules.md` for scope boundaries, DM rules, and the verification checklist.\n\n## Key Rules\n\n- **Independence is mandatory.** Each dimension scored in isolation.\n- **Rubric is source of truth.** Apply Andi''s criteria exactly.\n- **Always score.** Never refuse due to missing data. Score with confidence qualifier (H/M/L) and document gaps.\n- **No DM quotes.** Paraphrase only.\n- **No compensation info.** Never include salary, bonus, or raise details.\n- **Compact output.** ~1,000-1,500 words. Scorecard with numbers, not prose narrative.\n- **No recommendations.** Action triggers flag which thresholds fired — Andi decides what to do.\n- **Quantity scores low even if client is the blocker.** Explicitly stated in rubric.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:20:08.082Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Analysis Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing advanced data extraction and scoring capabilities for account health assessment","zh":"适合于需要高级数据提取和评分能力的分析代理，如 Claude Code 或 AutoGPT，以评估账户健康状况","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの分析エージェントが、アカウントのヘルスチェックに高度なデータ抽出とスコアリング機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"클라우드 코드 또는 오토지피티와 같은 분석 에이전트가 계정 건강 상태를 평가하기 위해 고급 데이터 추출 및 평가 기능이 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis como Claude Code o AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de extracción y puntuación de datos para la evaluación de la salud de la cuenta","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse comme Claude Code ou AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités avancées d''extraction et de notation de données pour l''évaluation de la santé du compte","de":"Ideal für Analyseagenten wie Claude Code oder AutoGPT, die erweiterte Datenextraktions- und Bewertungsfunktionen für die Kontogesundheitsbewertung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise como Claude Code ou AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de extração e pontuação de dados para avaliação de saúde de conta","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа, таких как Claude Code или AutoGPT, требующих продвинутых возможностей извлечения и оценки данных для оценки здоровья аккаунта","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليليين مثل Claude Code أو AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لاستخراج البيانات وتقييمها لتقييم صحة الحساب"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to sequentially gather data from Fireflies transcripts, Slack history, and Notion pages, extracting relevant signals and comparing against EM self-reported scores using Andi''s rubric, while flagging misalignments and generating compact scorecards in a structured format","zh":"赋予代理顺序地从 Fireflies 转录、Slack 历史和 Notion 页面中收集数据，提取相关信号，并使用 Andi 的评估标准将其与 EM 自我报告的评分进行比较，同时标记不匹配并生成紧凑的评分卡，以结构化格式呈现","ja":"Fireflies のトランスクリプト、Slack の履歴、Notion ページからデータを順番に収集し、関連する信号を抽出し、Andi のルーブリックを使用して EM の自己報告スコアと比較し、不一致をフラグ付けし、コンパクトなスコアカードを構造化された形式で生成する機能をエージェントに提供","ko":"파이어플라이즈 기록, 슬랙 기록, 노션 페이지에서 데이터를 순차적으로 수집하여 관련 信号를 추출하고, 안디의 평가 기준을 사용하여 EM의 自己 報告 점수를 비교하고, 불일치를 플래그 지정하고, 구조화된 형식으로 컴팩트한 점수 카드를 생성하는 에이전트 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recopilar secuencialmente datos de transcripciones de Fireflies, historial de Slack y páginas de Notion, extrayendo señales relevantes y comparándolas con las puntuaciones autoinformadas de EM utilizando la rúbrica de Andi, mientras se marcan desalineaciones y se generan tarjetas de puntuación compactas en un formato estructurado","fr":"Permet aux agents de recueillir séquentiellement des données à partir de transcriptions Fireflies, d''historique Slack et de pages Notion, en extrayant des signaux pertinents et en les comparant aux scores auto-déclarés d''EM à l''aide de la grille d''Andi, tout en signalant les désalignements et en générant des fiches de score compactes dans un format structuré","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Daten aus Fireflies-Transkripten, Slack-Verlaufsdaten und Notion-Seiten sequenziell zu sammeln, relevante Signale zu extrahieren und mit den Selbstauskünften von EM unter Verwendung der Andi-Rubrik zu vergleichen, während Abweichungen markiert und kompakte Bewertungskarten in einem strukturierten Format generiert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coletar sequencialmente dados de transcrições do Fireflies, histórico do Slack e páginas do Notion, extrair sinais relevantes e compará-los com as pontuações auto-relatadas da EM usando a rubrica da Andi, enquanto sinaliza desalinhamentos e gera cartões de pontuação compactos em um formato estruturado","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью последовательно собирать данные из транскрипций Fireflies, истории Slack и страниц Notion, извлекать релевантные сигналы и сравнивать их с самооценочными баллами EM с использованием рубрики Andi, при этом флагируя несоответствия и генерируя компактные таблицы баллов в структурированном формате","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من جمع البيانات بالتسلسل من نصوص Fireflies وتاريخ Slack وصفحات Notion، واستخراج الإشارات ذات الصلة ومقارنتها بالدرجات الموضحة ذاتيًا من قبل EM باستخدام نظام التقييم الخاص بالاندي، مع إشارة الانحرافات وتوليد بطاقات درجات مدمجة بترتيب منظم"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating account health scoring for GrowthX clients","Generating compact scorecards with dimensional analysis","Flagging misalignments between EM self-reported scores and actual data"],"zh":["为 GrowthX 客户自动化账户健康评分","使用维度分析生成紧凑的评分卡","标记 EM 自我报告评分和实际数据之间的不匹配"],"ja":["GrowthX クライアントのアカウントヘルススコアリングを自動化する","次元分析を使用してコンパクトなスコアカードを生成する","EM の自己報告スコアと実際のデータの不一致をフラグ付けする"],"ko":["그루스엑스 고객의 계정 건강 평가를 자동화하는 것","차원 분석을 사용하여 컴팩트한 점수 카드를 생성하는 것","EM의 自己 報告 점수와 실제 데이터의 불일치를 플래그 지정하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la puntuación de la salud de la cuenta para los clientes de GrowthX","Generación de tarjetas de puntuación compactas con análisis dimensional","Señalización de desalineaciones entre las puntuaciones autoinformadas de EM y los datos reales"],"fr":["Automatisation de la notation de la santé du compte pour les clients de GrowthX","Génération de fiches de score compactes avec analyse dimensionnelle","Signalisation des désalignements entre les scores auto-déclarés d''EM et les données réelles"],"de":["Automatisierung der Kontogesundheitsbewertung für GrowthX-Kunden","Erzeugung kompakter Bewertungskarten mit dimensionsanalytischer Bewertung","Kennzeichnung von Abweichungen zwischen den Selbstauskünften von EM und den tatsächlichen Daten"],"pt":["Automatizar a pontuação de saúde da conta para os clientes do GrowthX","Gerar cartões de pontuação compactos com análise dimensional","Sinalizar desalinhamentos entre as pontuações auto-relatadas da EM e os dados reais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оценку здоровья аккаунта для клиентов GrowthX","Генерировать компактные таблицы баллов с dimensional анализом","Флагировать несоответствия между самооценочными баллами EM и фактическими данными"],"ar":["أتمتة تقييم صحة الحساب لزبائن GrowthX","توليد بطاقات درجات مدمجة بتحليل بعدي","إشارة الانحرافات بين الدرجات الموضحة ذاتيًا من قبل EM والبيانات الفعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Fireflies transcripts, Slack history, and Notion pages","Sequential data gathering may be heavy and time-consuming","Limited to 5 dimensions using Andi''s rubric"],"zh":["需要访问 Fireflies 转录、Slack 历史和 Notion 页面","顺序数据收集可能很重且耗时","仅限使用 Andi 的评估标准的 5 个维度"],"ja":["Fireflies のトランスクリプト、Slack の履歴、Notion ページへのアクセスが必要","順番にデータを収集することが重く時間がかかる場合がある","Andi のルーブリックを使用して 5 次元までに限定"],"ko":["파이어플라이즈 기록, 슬랙 기록, 노션 페이지에 접근할 수 있는 권한이 필요","순차적으로 데이터를 수집하는 것이 무거울 수 있으며 시간이 걸릴 수 있음","안디의 평가 기준을 사용하여 5개의 차원으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a transcripciones de Fireflies, historial de Slack y páginas de Notion","La recopilación secuencial de datos puede ser pesada y consume mucha tiempo","Limitado a 5 dimensiones utilizando la rúbrica de Andi"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux transcriptions Fireflies, à l''historique Slack et aux pages Notion","La collecte séquentielle de données peut être lourde et prendre du temps","Limité à 5 dimensions en utilisant la grille d''Andi"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Fireflies-Transkripte, Slack-Verlaufsdaten und Notion-Seiten","Die sequenzielle Datensammlung kann zeitaufwändig und ressourcenintensiv sein","Begrenzt auf 5 Dimensionen unter Verwendung der Andi-Rubrik"],"pt":["Requer acesso a transcrições do Fireflies, histórico do Slack e páginas do Notion","Coleta de dados sequencial pode ser pesada e demorada","Limitado a 5 dimensões usando a rubrica da Andi"],"ru":["Требует доступа к транс